OL,3,GNEWSAIndia trade trip 'a sign of
OL,4,Aintent' - say mayors
OL,5,
OL,6,FYorkshire's mayors have declared their
OL,7,Frecent trade trip to India a "no
OL,8,Fbrainer" and say they will go "wherever
OL,9,Fwe need to" to help the region.
OL,11,FThe trio of leaders travelled to
OL,12,FHyderabad and Mumbai last month to
OL,13,Fpromote Yorkshire's business and
OL,14,Feducation opportunities, signing a
OL,15,Fnumber of deals in the process.
OL,17,FHowever, questions have been raised
OL,18,Fover the cost of the trip to taxpayers,
OL,19,Fwith the exact price yet to be
OL,20,Frevealed.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
