OL,3,GNEWSAIndia trade trip 'a sign of
OL,4,Aintent' - say mayors
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Yorkshire Mayor Tracy Brabin said
OL,7,Fit was "100 times worth the cost of
OL,8,Fgoing", while North Yorkshire's David
OL,9,FSkaith has pledged the price will be
OL,10,Fpresented "in due course".
